I agree we should try to avoid making gismu that are too similar, or
making new gismu at all (there's a lot more room in fu'ivla space) but
for what little it's worth I find the sound similarities that do exist
very useful in creating Lojbanic art.  There's not much in the way of
full rhymes, so it's even more important to use similar sounding words
as a way of creating harmony and texture.

The only one that does bother me a little is:

